<ul><li><a href="/community/guide-placeholder/first-board" rel="ugc nofollow noopener">Start here: playing your first board</a></li><li><a href="/community/guide-placeholder/specials-and-stars" rel="ugc nofollow noopener">Special bricks, goals and score stars</a></li><li><a href="/community/guide-placeholder/journey" rel="ugc nofollow noopener">Finding your way around the Journey</a></li><li><a href="/community/guide-placeholder/voiceover" rel="ugc nofollow noopener">Playing with VoiceOver</a></li><li><a href="/community/guide-placeholder/lives-moves-undos" rel="ugc nofollow noopener">Lives, moves, undos and optional videos</a></li><li><a href="/community/guide-placeholder/asking-for-help" rel="ugc nofollow noopener">Getting help and reporting an accessibility problem</a></li><li><a href="/community/guide-placeholder/versions" rel="ugc nofollow noopener">Which game version am I playing?</a></li></ul>';
BEGIN
 SELECT thread_id INTO tid FROM player_guides WHERE locale = 'en' AND key = 'settings';
 IF tid IS NULL THEN RETURN; END IF;
 FOR target IN SELECT g.key, t.id, t.slug FROM player_guides g JOIN threads t ON t.id = g.thread_id WHERE g.locale = 'en' LOOP
  old_md := replace(old_md, '/community/guide-placeholder/' || target.key, '/community/t/' || target.id || '/' || target.slug);
  new_md := replace(new_md, '/community/guide-placeholder/' || target.key, '/community/t/' || target.id || '/' || target.slug);
  new_html := replace(new_html, '/community/guide-placeholder/' || target.key, '/community/t/' || target.id || '/' || target.slug);
 END LOOP;
 UPDATE posts SET body_md = new_md, body_html = new_html WHERE thread_id = tid AND number = 1 AND body_md = old_md;
END $guide$;

DO $guide$
DECLARE tid bigint; target record; old_md text := 'Checked 7 October 2026 · released iOS 5.0.1

Opening a board needs a life but spends none. Clearing spends none. A life goes when you decline the out-of-moves continue, leave after making a move, or restart after making a move. Five lives, eight with Brick Pass; one refills every thirty minutes.

The board shows moves remaining; there is no clock or countdown. At the limit, five extra moves cost 300 coins, then 500, then 900 within the same attempt, or a rewarded video. Leaving or clearing resets the coin ladder.

The first undo on each board is free. Further undos use a tank of five, recovering one every twenty-five minutes; a rewarded undo video pays two. Check the displayed count before using another undo. Unlimited undo belongs only to the separate classic browser demo.

Daily caps: lives 8, undos 8, extra moves 6, a free Hint at the out-of-moves wall 4, doubled clear coins 4, Brick Wheel 1, the gift balloon 2 and Brick Cinema 6. No banners or interstitials. A video starts only when you choose it; declining costs nothing.

