A calm match-three puzzle with 2,000 boards, 167 brick-built villages and nine 3D brick friends. Swap neighbouring bricks, match three or more, and meet each board’s goals. No timer; every board plays offline.

In development · Slide & Match for 5.1

The next iOS update is being tested. It combines slides into empty space, exits through matching gates and neighbour swaps, with twelve board types per village, larger bricks and VoiceOver slide actions. Community and Report a bug buttons in Settings and refreshed Settings controls are also in development. This is not yet an App Store release; the final board audit and release checks are still in progress.

Try the classic sliding board in your browser

This browser demo preserves OutBrick’s earlier sliding puzzle: move bricks through matching gates. It is a separate web game, with unlimited undo here. The current iOS app uses matches, cascades, goals and score-based stars; the demo is not a preview of 5.1.

